      "summary": {
        "en": "After using the Basic ATK \"Direct Punch\" or the Skill \"Lacerating Fist,\" receives 1 stack of Fighting Will. When 2 or more stacks of Fighting Will are present, Basic ATK becomes Enhanced.\nIf the enemy is Bleeding, the Enhanced Basic ATK will cause Bleed to deal extra DMG for 1 time.",
        "zh-CN": "施放普攻【直冲拳】和战技【裂伤拳】后，获得1层【斗志】。当持有的【斗志】大于等于2层时，获得强化普攻。\n若敌方目标处于裂伤状态，则强化普攻使裂伤状态额外产生1次伤害。"
